; The Synthetic Heart Rift Summoner: a teleportation pod a person fits in (2.2 m, the origin on the floor in the middle of its base, the front +Z like a cabinet's). Its parts are
; built by summoner_model.gd when it enters the tree (they must be direct children
; for the highlight). Layer 4 and mask 196613 are what every pickable here has, and
; PointerArea on layer 21 (kept inside the shell, so the screen bolted outside it is hit FIRST by a ray) is what the Tab / point-and-press raycast looks for: without
; it the object cannot be picked up by the hand or opened with Tab.
[node name="RiftSummoner" type="RigidBody3D" groups=["spawned"]]
collision_layer = 4
collision_mask = 196613
mass = 60.0
physics_material_override = SubResource("PhysMat_summoner")
linear_damp = 4.0
angular_damp = 8.0
script = ExtResource("1_summoner")

[node name="Collision" type="CollisionShape3D" parent="."]
transform = Transform3D(1, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 1.105, 0)
shape = SubResource("Shape_body")

[node name="PickableHighlight" type="Node3D" parent="."]
